<title>USA: U.S. Treasury balances at Fed rose on April 24.</title>
<headline>U.S. Treasury balances at Fed rose on April 24.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-04-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. Treasury balances at Federal Reserve based on Treasury Department's latest budget statement.</p>
<p>			  (BILLIONS OF DLRS)</p>
<p>				April 24	     April 23</p>
<p>Fed acct			16.485		 15.463</p>
<p>Tax/loan note acct	  37.130		 34.530</p>
<p>Cash balance		  53.614		 50.393</p>
<p>---</p>
<p>Total public debt,</p>
<p> subject to limit	5,256.958	     5,259.098</p>
<p>---</p>
<p>Treasury said individual income tax refunds valued at $3 million were issued and $56 million of corporate refunds were issued.</p>
</text>
